  m_text: 'Privacy Policy

    Effective Date: 18/03/2025


    1. Introduction

    InstaRecipe
    values your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy
    Policy outlines how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when using
    our application.


    2. Data Collection

    We may collect the following information:


    Personal
    Information: Email address and authentication details for account creation.

    User
    Preferences: Dietary restrictions, ingredient inputs, and saved recipes.

    Device
    Information: IP address, browser type, and app usage analytics.

    3. How We
    Use Your Data

    Your data is used to:

    Provide personalized recipe recommendations.

    Improve
    app functionality and user experience.

    Enhance security and prevent unauthorized
    access.


    4. Data Security

    We implement encryption and secure authentication
    to protect user data. Personal information is not shared with third parties without
    consent, except as required by law.


    5. User Rights

    You have the right
    to:

    Access, update, or delete your account data.

    Withdraw consent for
    data collection.

    Contact us for any privacy-related concerns.


    6. Changes
    to this Policy

    We may update this policy periodically. Users will be notified
    of significant changes.


    7. Contact Information

    For questions about
    this Privacy Policy, contact us at [Insert Contact Email].'
